CORE gcc-only
main.cpp
--cpp11 --object-bits 12
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ tolower: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
