no body for callee
--
The classic ctype<char> facet model had no vtable pointer, and libstdc++
defines ctype<char>::do_tolower in the shared library: "dereference
failure: pointer NULL in ...do_tolower" (regex_traits::translate_nocase
in cpp11_regex_construct and cpp11_regex_match).
